{"id": "2ef5d5ea-502b-4af7-a9ac-2436113bae5e", "slug": "lumina-modular-lighting-system", "title": "Lumina | Modular Lighting System", "description": "Lumina Modular Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Lumina | Modular Lighting System\"\ndescription: \"Lumina Modular Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#D4C1A5\"\n  secondary: \"#0C0E0C\"\n  accent: \"#99866B\"\n  background: \"#060807\"\n  surface: \"#D4C1A5\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#8E938F\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Lumina | Modular Lighting System\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 20; favorites: 7; remixes: 2.\nTags: card, animated, threejs, bento, dither, action, effect.\n## Overview\nLumina Modular Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nLUMINA View Specs Home About Collection Contact Modular Lighting System LUMINA CORE Designed to shape atmosphere through precision lighting and timeless materials. Experience architectural depth. Explore Collection\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: LUMINA; LUMINA CORE.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #D4C1A5, secondary #0C0E0C, accent #99866B, background #060807, surface #D4C1A5, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Lumina | Modular Lighting System</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#060807] text-[#e8e4dc] font-sans antialiased h-screen w-screen overflow-hidden relative selection:bg-[#d4c1a5]/30 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Micro Grain Texture Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-50 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.04] mix-blend-overlay\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.8%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Background Gradients & Ambient Light -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_50%,_rgba(15,22,18,1)_0%,_rgba(6,8,7,1)_100%)] z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div id=\"ambient-glow\" class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-[-15vw] -translate-y-1/2 w-[50vw] h-[70vh] bg-[#d4c1a5] opacity-[0.03] blur-[120px] rounded-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Architectural Background Lines / Faint Grid -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 10vw 10vw;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Massive Background Typography -->\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-8vh] md:bottom-[-12vh] left-0 w-full text-center z-0 pointer-events-none select-none flex justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n        <h1 id=\"bg-text\" class=\"text-[25vw] leading-[0.75] font-semibold tracking-tighter text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-[#d4c1a5]/[0.08] to-transparent translate-y-[20%] opacity-0\">LUMINA</h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main 3D Parallax Scene -->\n    <main id=\"scene\" class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center z-10\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n\n        <!-- Background Card 1 (Top Left) -->\n        <div class=\"parallax-bg absolute top-[10%] left-[8%] w-[45vw] md:w-[35vw] aspect-[4/3] bg-[#0c0e0c] rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden blur-[4px] opacity-30 z-10 hidden md:block\" data-depth=\"0.04\" style=\"transform: translateZ(-200px) rotateX(5deg) rotateY(-10deg);\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/724142aa-44a6-48d3-9cf3-761e00d05b78_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Architecture\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 scale-110\" />\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Background Card 2 (Bottom Right) -->\n        <div class=\"parallax-bg absolute bottom-[8%] right-[5%] w-[40vw] md:w-[30vw] aspect-[16/10] bg-[#0c0e0c] rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden blur-[6px] opacity-20 z-10 hidden md:block\" data-depth=\"0.06\" style=\"transform: translateZ(-300px) rotateX(-5deg) rotateY(15deg);\">\n             <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/50 z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n             <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/5ee0a38a-b5d3-4531-8793-98beed4af162_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Architecture Details\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-50 scale-110\" />\n             <!-- Faint button mock on bg card -->\n             <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 right-6 border border-[#d4c1a5]/30 rounded-full px-6 py-2 text-[10px] text-[#d4c1a5]/50 tracking-widest uppercase blur-[1px]\">View Specs</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main Focal Card -->\n        <div id=\"main-card\" class=\"relative w-[92vw] md:w-[75vw] lg:w-[68vw] max-w-[1200px] aspect-[4/5] md:aspect-[16/9] bg-[#0a0c0b]/80 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-[#d4c1a5]/[0.15] rounded-2xl shadow-[0_30px_100px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] overflow-hidden z-30 flex flex-col group origin-center opacity-0 scale-95\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n\n            <!-- Cinematic Glass Sweep Effect -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-[200%] h-[200%] top-[-50%] left-[-50%] bg-gradient-to-tr from-transparent via-white/[0.04] to-transparent rotate-45 translate-x-[-100%] group-hover:translate-x-[100%] transition-transform duration-[1500ms] ease-in-out z-50 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Top Navigation -->\n            <nav class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-6 py-5 md:px-10 md:py-8 border-b border-white/[0.03] relative z-40\">\n                <!-- Minimal Logo -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center text-[#d4c1a5] hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity cursor-pointer\">\n                    <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" class=\"opacity-90\">\n                        <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5\"/>\n                        <circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Desktop Links -->\n                <div class=\"hidden md:flex gap-10 text-xs tracking-wider uppercase font-medium text-[#8e938f]\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#d4c1a5] transition-colors relative group/link py-1\">\n                        Home\n                        <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#d4c1a5] transition-all duration-300 ease-out group-hover/link:w-full\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#d4c1a5] transition-colors relative group/link py-1\">\n                        About\n                        <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#d4c1a5] transition-all duration-300 ease-out group-hover/link:w-full\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[#d4c1a5] relative group/link py-1\"> <!-- Active state -->\n                        Collection\n                        <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-[#d4c1a5]\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#d4c1a5] transition-colors relative group/link py-1\">\n                        Contact\n                        <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#d4c1a5] transition-all duration-300 ease-out group-hover/link:w-full\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Mobile Menu Icon -->\n                <div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center text-[#d4c1a5] cursor-pointer\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Card Content Area -->\n            <div class=\"relative flex-1 w-full h-full flex overflow-hidden\">\n\n                <!-- Internal Left Edge Glow -->\n                <div class=\"absolute left-[-2%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[15%] h-[80%] bg-[#d4c1a5] opacity-20 blur-[60px] rounded-full z-0 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Center Main Background Image (Subtle) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[15%] md:top-[20%] left-[5%] md:left-[10%] w-[85%] md:w-[60%] h-[50%] overflow-hidden rounded-sm z-10 opacity-70\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 z-10\"></div> <!-- Darkening overlay -->\n                    <img id=\"main-img\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/005600e5-f6ab-4e59-bc86-eaeb02797dfa_1600w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover scale-105\" alt=\"Modern Interior\" />\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Vertical Image Slices (Editorial Style) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[10%] md:top-[12%] right-[5%] w-[40%] md:w-[24%] h-[75%] hidden md:flex gap-[2px] z-20\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-hidden bg-[#0c0e0c] relative slice-panel opacity-0 translate-x-[20px]\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/7f78131e-65e9-49b2-aa1f-ccc33e28df9f_1600w.webp\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-[300%] max-w-none h-full object-cover opacity-90 grayscale-[20%]\" alt=\"Interior Detail 1\" />\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-hidden bg-[#0c0e0c] relative slice-panel opacity-0 translate-x-[20px]\">\n                         <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/7f78131e-65e9-49b2-aa1f-ccc33e28df9f_1600w.webp\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-[-100%] w-[300%] max-w-none h-full object-cover opacity-90 grayscale-[20%]\" alt=\"Interior Detail 2\" />\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-hidden bg-[#0c0e0c] relative slice-panel opacity-0 translate-x-[20px]\">\n                         <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/7f78131e-65e9-49b2-aa1f-ccc33e28df9f_1600w.webp\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-[-200%] w-[300%] max-w-none h-full object-cover opacity-90 grayscale-[20%]\" alt=\"Interior Detail 3\" />\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Text Overlay Content -->\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-[8%] md:bottom-[12%] left-[6%] md:left-[10%] z-30 pointer-events-none flex flex-col justify-end\">\n\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] md:text-xs text-[#d4c1a5] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-medium mb-4 opacity-0\" id=\"reveal-sub\">Modular Lighting System</p>\n\n                    <!-- Masked Title Reveal Structure -->\n                    <h2 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.5rem] font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-[0.9] text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ffffff] via-[#e6d5bc] to-[#99866b] flex flex-col items-start drop-shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\">\n                        <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block py-1\">\n                            <span class=\"inline-block translate-y-[110%] title-word\">LUMINA</span>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block py-1\">\n                            <span class=\"inline-block translate-y-[110%] title-word\">CORE</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </h2>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-[#a3a8a5] mt-6 max-w-[280px] md:max-w-sm font-light leading-relaxed opacity-0\" id=\"reveal-desc\">\n                        Designed to shape atmosphere through precision lighting and timeless materials. Experience architectural depth.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <!-- Call to Action -->\n                    <button class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-[#d4c1a5] uppercase tracking-widest font-medium hover:text-white transition-all pointer-events-auto opacity-0 group/cta\" id=\"reveal-cta\">\n                        <span class=\"relative\">\n                            Explore Collection\n                            <span class=\"absolute bottom-[-4px] left-0 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#d4c1a5] transition-all duration-300 ease-out group-hover/cta:w-full\"></span>\n                        </span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg transform group-hover/cta:translate-x-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Fade Gradient for Text Readability -->\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[40%] bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a0c0b] to-transparent z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Timeline for Initial Load Animations\n        const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power3.out\" } });\n\n        // 1. Fade in Backgrounds\n        tl.to(\".parallax-bg\", {\n            opacity: (i, el) => el.classList.contains('opacity-30') ? 0.3 : 0.2, // restore opacity\n            duration: 1.5,\n            stagger: 0.2\n        }, 0);\n\n        // 2. Main Card Entrance (Scale & Fade)\n        tl.to(\"#main-card\", {\n            opacity: 1,\n            scale: 1,\n            duration: 1.2,\n            ease: \"expo.out\"\n        }, 0.2);\n\n        // 3. Image Slices Slide in\n        tl.to(\".slice-panel\", {\n            opacity: 1,\n            x: 0,\n            duration: 1,\n            stagger: 0.15\n        }, 0.6);\n\n        // 4. Subtle Zoom on Main Internal Image\n        tl.to(\"#main-img\", {\n            scale: 1,\n            duration: 3,\n            ease: \"power1.out\"\n        }, 0.5);\n\n        // 5. Masked Staggered Text Reveal\n        tl.to(\".title-word\", {\n            y: \"0%\",\n            duration: 1,\n            stagger: 0.15,\n            ease: \"power4.out\"\n        }, 0.8);\n\n        // 6. Subtext & CTA Fade In\n        tl.to([\"#reveal-sub\", \"#reveal-desc\", \"#reveal-cta\"], {\n            opacity: 1,\n            y: 0,\n            duration: 1,\n            stagger: 0.1\n        }, 1.2);\n\n        // 7. Massive Background Text Reveal (Slowly)\n        tl.to(\"#bg-text\", {\n            y: \"0%\",\n            opacity: 1,\n            duration: 2,\n            ease: \"power2.out\"\n        }, 0.5);\n\n        // Ambient Glow Soft Pulse\n        gsap.to(\"#ambient-glow\", {\n            opacity: 0.06,\n            scale: 1.05,\n            duration: 4,\n            repeat: -1,\n            yoyo: true,\n            ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n        });\n\n        // Interactive Parallax on Mouse Move\n        const scene = document.getElementById('scene');\n        const mainCard = document.getElementById('main-card');\n        const bgCards = document.querySelectorAll('.parallax-bg');\n\n        let isHoveringMain = false;\n\n        mainCard.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => isHoveringMain = true);\n        mainCard.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n            isHoveringMain = false;\n            // Reset main card slightly when mouse leaves\n            gsap.to(mainCard, { rotateX: 0, rotateY: 0, scale: 1, duration: 1, ease: \"power3.out\" });\n        });\n\n        window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            const x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 2; // -1 to 1\n            const y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 2; // -1 to 1\n\n            // Move Background Cards (More depth, opposite direction)\n            bgCards.forEach(card => {\n                const depth = parseFloat(card.dataset.depth);\n                gsap.to(card, {\n                    x: x * depth * -1000,\n                    y: y * depth * -1000,\n                    duration: 2,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\",\n                    overwrite: \"auto\"\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Move Main Card (Subtle 3D rotation)\n            if (window.innerWidth > 768) {\n                // If hovering main card, reduce rotation and push forward slightly\n                const scaleTarget = isHoveringMain ? 1.02 : 1;\n                const rotMultiplier = isHoveringMain ? 1 : 3;\n\n                gsap.to(mainCard, {\n                    rotateX: y * -rotMultiplier, // Invert Y for natural feel\n                    rotateY: x * rotMultiplier,\n                    scale: scaleTarget,\n                    duration: 1,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\",\n                    overwrite: \"auto\"\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "lumina-modular-lighting-system.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s-v3/lumina-modular-lighting-system.jpg", "source_name": "lumina-modular-lighting-system-DESIGN.md", "views": 83, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T15:56:49.469683+00:00"}